  <section class="fa-story" aria-labelledby="fa-story-title">
    <div class="fa-wrap fa-story-grid">
      <div><span class="fa-eyebrow">Our Story</span><h2 class="fa-heading" id="fa-story-title">Roots that shape our <span class="fa-heading-accent">future.</span></h2><p class="fa-story-kicker">From adult competition<br>to building the next generation</p></div>
      <div class="fa-history">
        <article class="fa-history-item"><h3 class="fa-card-title">Adult &amp; Professional Roots</h3><p>Fury's story includes men's and women's adult soccer and championship competition. That history remains part of how Fayetteville's soccer community remembers the club.</p></article>
        <article class="fa-history-item"><h3 class="fa-card-title">Today's Youth Focus</h3><p>The organization has evolved toward a youth-focused identity. Experience from the club's past now brings perspective to the work of developing young players.</p></article>
        <article class="fa-history-item"><h3 class="fa-card-title">Future Possibilities</h3><p>Long term, Fury hopes the growth of its youth players can help the organization eventually return to adult competition, both indoor and outdoor. That is a future aspiration—not a current program.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fa-milestones" aria-labelledby="fa-milestones-title">
    <div class="fa-wrap">
      <span class="fa-eyebrow">Recent Milestones</span>
      <h2 class="fa-heading" id="fa-milestones-title">Moments in the Fury story.</h2>
      <div class="fa-stats">
        <article class="fa-stat"><span class="fa-stat-number">2023</span><p class="fa-stat-label">NISL Men's Champions</p></article>
