        <article class="fa-stat"><span class="fa-stat-number">2025–2026</span><p class="fa-stat-label">High school teams reached the playoffs in all of their tournaments and won three of five</p></article>
        <article class="fa-stat"><span class="fa-stat-number">2026–2027</span><p class="fa-stat-label">10U KOSA Tournament Finalist — the team's first finalist placement</p></article>
